</sec>
<sec id="ai-usage-disclosure">
  <title>AI usage disclosure</title>
  <p>No generative AI was used in the creation of the software,
  interfaces, implementation of algorithms, or documentation. ChatGPT
  was used to check spelling, grammar, and clarity of the English text
  in this paper.</p>
</sec>
